{"page":417,"verses":[{"verse_key":"32:21","surah":32,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَنُذِيقَنَّهُم مِّنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ ٱلْأَدْنَىٰ دُونَ ٱلْعَذَابِ ٱلْأَكْبَرِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَرْجِعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We shall certainly make them taste a nearer torment [in this life] prior to the greater torment, so that perhaps they may return [to the right path].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَنُذِيقَنَّهُم","en_gloss":"And surely, We will let them taste","transliteration":"walanudhīqannahum","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَدْنَىٰ","en_gloss":"the nearer","transliteration":"l-adnā","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"دُونَ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"dūna","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَكْبَرِ","en_gloss":"the greater","transliteration":"l-akbari","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَرْجِعُونَ","en_gloss":"return","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","verse_key":"32:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"32:21"}]},{"verse_key":"32:22","surah":32,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَنْ أَظْلَمُ مِمَّن ذُكِّرَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِۦ ثُمَّ أَعْرَضَ عَنْهَآ ۚ إِنَّا مِنَ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ مُنتَقِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who does more wrong than someone who, when messages from his Lord are recited to him, turns away from them? We shall inflict retribution on the guilty.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"32:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَظْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) more unjust","transliteration":"aẓlamu","verse_key":"32:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِمَّن","en_gloss":"than (he) who","t